---
layout: default
title: Page Not Found
description: The page you are looking for does not exist.
---

<div class="shell main-404-content" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 60vh; text-align: center;">
  <div style="max-width: 480px; padding: var(--spacing-xl) 0;">
    <p style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);">
      Error 404
    </p>
    
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text); margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm) 0; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
      Page not found
    </h1>

    <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-xl) 0;">
      Sorry, we couldn’t find the page you’re looking for. Perhaps the URL has changed, or the page has been permanently moved.
    </p>

    <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--spacing-md); justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <a href="/" class="btn" style="background: var(--text); color: var(--bg-deep) !important; font-weight: 600; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: var(--radius); border: 1px solid transparent; transition: opacity 0.15s ease;">
        Go back home
      </a>
      <a href="/showcases/" class="btn" style="background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text); padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: var(--radius); transition: border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;">
        View showcases
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
